<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The shell: navigation pane, header, and the frame every page lives in.

  This one file replaces four WinForms types — NavigationRail (188 hand-painted lines), the
  breadcrumb strip, the search box row and MainForm's manual page swapping — and fixes by
  construction the note left at MainForm.cs:422, that 搜索 and 服务器 had to be listed by hand
  because neither had a rail entry. Here every destination is a NavigationViewItem, so the pane,
  the keyboard order, the narrator names and the back stack all agree without being kept in sync.

  The sign-in card is a sibling of the NavigationView rather than a page inside the frame: one
  window, one theme root, one XamlRoot, and signing out shows a control that is already built
  instead of rebuilding the tree.

  Deliberately no transitions anywhere (requirement 9: no fading, show on hover immediately).
  NavigationView's own pane animation stays, because that is a user-initiated toggle rather than
  something appearing under the pointer.

  RequestedTheme 不写在这里：一套浅色主题要靠把这棵树翻成 ElementTheme.Light 才能让框架自己那几百个
  没被 Palette.xaml 覆盖的刷子跟着走，所以深浅由 ThemeHost.Register 在构造时按当前主题设，换主题时再
  改一次。写死 Dark 等于让浅色主题只换一半。
-->
<UserControl
    x:Class="EmbyNian.Shell.Views.ShellPage"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:local="using:EmbyNian.Shell.Views"
    xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
    xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
    mc:Ignorable="d"
    FontFamily="{StaticResource EgUiFontFamily}"
    FontSize="{StaticResource EgBodyFontSize}">

    <!--
      One row, not two. The title-bar strip used to be row 0 and everything else row 1; now the work area
      runs from the window's very top edge and the strip floats over it, because 主页 的大图要铺满顶上
      那一整块（「红框框出来的地方全填充上海报」）—— 一条 32 像素高的实心条压在大图上，等于在图的顶上留了
      一道黑边，那正是那个要求要去掉的东西。

      叠放次序写成 Canvas.ZIndex 而不是靠声明顺序：这四块的上下关系是「侧边栏和页面 → 标题栏 → 播放器 →
      通知」，写成数字，读这个文件的人不用在心里数元素的先后。标题栏留在原地（第一块），因为它是这个窗口的
      外壳，读起来该在最前面。

      窗口顶上原来还有一条通栏发丝线（标题栏和工作区之间那道缝）。它没有了：大图现在铺到窗口顶边，一条横
      穿窗口的线会从图上划过去。侧边栏和工作区之间那道竖线还在，而且现在从 y=0 通到底 —— 顶上这一块的边，
      由它一根说完。
    -->
    <Grid>
        <!-- App-drawn title bar, laid out the way the Claude app lays the same strip out: the app's mark at
             the left end, then a flat row of icon buttons — 折叠侧边栏, 设置, 搜索, 后退, 前进 — with the two
             arrows dimmed rather than removed when there is nowhere to go.

             需求 1 的第一句是「去掉窗口标题的 EmbyNian」, so the word is gone and only the mark is left. It
             stays because the strip's left end has to remain something to drag the window by, and a hit-test
             transparent icon is exactly that.

             底色是 Transparent，不是 EgWindowBrush：这一条压在侧边栏和工作区的上面，两边各自把自己那半
             画上来（侧边栏是它自己的底色，工作区是 ContentHost 的底色，主页上则是大图本身），所以这一条
             只出按钮，不出底。

             The right side is reserved for the OS caption buttons; everything else is declared draggable
             non-client area by HostWindow except this row, which it cuts a passthrough hole for. That hole
             is not decoration: a button drawn inside a caption region never receives a click at all, because
             the frame claims the point before XAML sees it and Windows turns the press into a window drag.
             ShellPage measures TitleActions and reports the rectangle, so the hole is always where the
             buttons actually are rather than where this markup implies they are — which is also why all five
             sit in one panel and not in two: one panel is one rectangle. -->
        <Grid
            x:Name="AppTitleBar"
            Canvas.ZIndex="10"
            Height="32"
            Padding="0,0,148,0"
            VerticalAlignment="Top"
            Background="Transparent">
            <!-- On the strip rather than on each button: resources cascade, so all five take the same fills
                 and the same 34×26 plate. The framework's own button fills are opaque and would read as
                 boxes dropped on the title bar, and its disabled fill would read as a grey one — an
                 unavailable arrow should be dim ink, not a plate.
                 The two hover fills are missing here on purpose: they are the shared EgOverlay* brush
                 objects, put under these keys by the constructor. See ShellPage.PaintTitleActions — a
                 literal colour here cannot follow a theme switch, and 晴昼's strip is white, where the
                 translucent white this used to hold is nothing at all. -->
            <Grid.Resources>
                <SolidColorBrush x:Key="ButtonBackgroundDisabled" Color="Transparent" />
                <SolidColorBrush x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushPointerOver" Color="Transparent" />
                <SolidColorBrush x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushPressed" Color="Transparent" />
                <SolidColorBrush x:Key="ButtonBorderBrushDisabled" Color="Transparent" />

                <!-- 托盘回到 34×26（「算了，改回原来的大小吧」）。中间试过 38×30、又试过 40×32 顶满标题栏这
                     一条的整高 —— 试过就是试过，尺寸退回原样，只留下图标本身的形状：见下面每一颗自己的
                     PathIcon。那一步没退，因为它答的是另一句话（「图标要圆润一点」），Segoe 那套字形的直笔画
                     是平头切断的，多大都还是「硬」，字体里没有开关能改。 -->

                <!-- Implicit, and scoped to this strip: five buttons repeating the same six properties is
                     five chances for one of them to be 2 pixels out, and the hole cut in the drag region is
                     measured off the row they make. BasedOn is not optional — a Button style without it
                     replaces the template. -->
                <Style BasedOn="{StaticResource DefaultButtonStyle}" TargetType="Button">
                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
                    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
                    <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource EgCardCornerRadius}" />
                    <Setter Property="Height" Value="26" />
                    <Setter Property="Width" Value="34" />
                    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
                </Style>

                <!-- 20×20，写死：下面五颗形状都画在这个方框里、围着 (10,10) 对称，可 PathIcon 既不缩放几何、也
                     不替你把它挪到中间 —— 它照 Data 里的坐标画，自己的尺寸取几何外框的右下角，于是左上那点留白
                     被算了两遍，一颗对称的图标会往左上偏半点。把方框还回来，五颗就都正对着托盘的中心。 -->
                <Style TargetType="PathIcon">
                    <Setter Property="Width" Value="20" />
                    <Setter Property="Height" Value="20" />
                </Style>
            </Grid.Resources>

            <!-- 左边那一段是留白，不是给谁站的位置：标题栏左端得有一块拖得动的地方，而窗口挖的那个洞就是
                 下面这个面板的矩形，挖到窗口边上就没地方拖了。这里原先画着一颗绿色的应用商标（「左上角这个绿标
                 移除掉」）—— 商标走了，缩进留着，那一排按键一颗都没动。

                 留白宽多少跟着侧边栏走，**两个值**（「折叠状态下图标要向右移动一些，防止图标和侧边栏重合」）：
                 侧边栏张开是 248 宽，这一排整个站在它自己的底色上，缩进 40；侧边栏收成 48 的窄条时 40 会让第一
                 颗托盘正好压在窄条和工作区之间那道竖线上 —— 半边在窄条里、半边在片场里，那就是用户说的「重合」。
                 收着的时候缩进换成 58，整排让到线的右边。这里写的是张开那个值，真正决定它的是
                 ShellPage.xaml.cs 的 SyncPane（收放时改一次，开窗时也算一次）—— 数只写在一处，见那段说明。 -->
            <StackPanel
                x:Name="TitleActions"
                Margin="40,0,0,0"
                Orientation="Horizontal"
                Spacing="2"
                VerticalAlignment="Center"
                HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                <!-- 需求 1 的第一颗：侧边栏收放。NavigationView's own toggle is off, because it sits inside the
                     pane and this row is where the window's chrome now lives. -->
                <Button
                    x:Name="PaneButton"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="折叠侧边栏"
                    Click="OnPaneToggleClicked"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="折叠/展开侧边栏">
                    <!-- 五颗图标都是自己画的形状，不是字形（「改成这种风格」：细线，一笔 1.4 粗，两头圆）。
                         那 1.4 是这一排的默认：箭头的杆、这块面板的边框，量出来都是它（「线条粗细要和箭头一样」）；
                         只有齿轮那一颗是 1.1，理由写在它自己那段里（「线条细一点」）。
                         直笔画是一颗「胶囊」—— 一条直边配两头各半个圆，所以两端天生是圆头；闭合的轮廓（面板、
                         齿轮、镜片那个圈）是「外框顺着走一圈 ＋ 内框倒着走一圈」，倒着那一圈把中间掏空，剩下的
                         就是一条同样粗的线。都画在同一个 20×20 的方框里、围着 (10,10) 对称，所以摆进 34×26 的
                         托盘里不用再逐颗对位。
                         几何是 tools/line-icons.awk 算出来的，不是手写的：齿轮那圈内框的每个拐角是两条边各往里
                         平移一条线的粗细之后的交点，手算必错，而错一位在 20 像素上就是歪一格。
                         这一颗画的是「侧边栏在不在」：一块面板，左边一竖分出一条窄栏（竖线在三分之一处，窄栏
                         4.7 宽，就是真侧边栏收起时那条 48 像素窄条的意思）。上一版是三条横线，那是通用菜单，
                         说不出它管的是侧边栏。竖线两端算到外框的边上，圆头整个埋进上下两条边的线里。 -->
                    <PathIcon Data="M 5.3,4.2 L 14.7,4.2 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 17.1,6.6 L 17.1,13.4 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 14.7,15.8 L 5.3,15.8 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 2.9,13.4 L 2.9,6.6 A 2.4,2.4 0 0 1 5.3,4.2 Z M 5.3,5.6 A 1,1 0 0 0 4.3,6.6 L 4.3,13.4 A 1,1 0 0 0 5.3,14.4 L 14.7,14.4 A 1,1 0 0 0 15.7,13.4 L 15.7,6.6 A 1,1 0 0 0 14.7,5.6 Z M 8.33,4.9 L 8.33,15.1 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 6.93,15.1 L 6.93,4.9 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 8.33,4.9 Z" />
                </Button>

                <!-- 设置：a window of its own, not a page in the frame — 「点击后弹出设置窗口」. -->
                <Button
                    x:Name="SettingsButton"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="设置"
                    Click="OnSettingsClicked"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="设置">
                    <!-- 齿轮：一圈齿形的轮廓线（齿顶 8.7、齿根 6.5，差出来的 1.1 就是那条线）＋ 中间一颗轴心的
                         圈（外 2.9、内 1.8，也是 1.1）。
                         六颗齿、线比这一排别的图标细一档（「把左上角的齿轮改回6个齿轮，线条细一点」）。两件事是
                         一件：齿距 60° 时齿间那道槽只有 26°，在 6.5 的半径上 2.95 像素，线越粗槽里剩的黑越少，
                         1.4 那一档六颗齿就糊成了一圈花边 —— 上一版正是为这个才退到五颗齿的。
                         齿顶半角 14°、齿根半角 17°：齿往上收窄 3°，所以这道槽从下往上是敞开的，齿数多也数得清。 -->
                    <PathIcon Data="M 8.1,3.78 L 7.9,1.56 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 12.1,1.56 L 11.9,3.78 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 14.43,5.25 L 16.26,3.96 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 18.36,7.6 L 16.33,8.54 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 16.33,11.46 L 18.36,12.4 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 16.26,16.04 L 14.43,14.75 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 11.9,16.22 L 12.1,18.44 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 7.9,18.44 L 8.1,16.22 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 5.57,14.75 L 3.74,16.04 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 1.64,12.4 L 3.67,11.46 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 3.67,8.54 L 1.64,7.6 A 8.7,8.7 0 0 1 3.74,3.96 L 5.57,5.25 A 6.5,6.5 0 0 1 8.1,3.78 Z M 9.28,4.57 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 5.66,6.66 L 3.88,5.4 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 2.95,7 L 4.94,7.91 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 4.94,12.09 L 2.95,13 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 3.88,14.6 L 5.66,13.34 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 9.28,15.43 L 9.08,17.6 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 10.92,17.6 L 10.72,15.43 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 14.34,13.34 L 16.12,14.6 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 17.05,13 L 15.06,12.09 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 15.06,7.91 L 17.05,7 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 16.12,5.4 L 14.34,6.66 A 5.4,5.4 0 0 0 10.72,4.57 L 10.92,2.4 A 7.6,7.6 0 0 0 9.08,2.4 L 9.28,4.57 Z M 10,7.1 A 2.9,2.9 0 0 1 10,12.9 A 2.9,2.9 0 0 1 10,7.1 Z M 10,8.2 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 0 10,11.8 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 0 10,8.2 Z" />
                </Button>

                <!-- 搜索：the opposite — 「直接在当前窗口跳转」, so it is a page in this frame. -->
                <Button
                    x:Name="SearchButton"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="搜索"
                    Click="OnSearchClicked"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="搜索">
                    <!-- 放大镜：一个圈（外 5.5、内 4.1，差出来的 1.4 就是那条线）＋ 一根圆头的柄。柄的内端停在
                         半径 4.82 上，够不到 4.1 那个洞 —— 差这 0.7 是故意的，柄伸进去一点镜片里就会多出一小截。 -->
                    <PathIcon Data="M 8.5,3 A 5.5,5.5 0 0 1 8.5,14 A 5.5,5.5 0 0 1 8.5,3 Z M 8.5,4.4 A 4.1,4.1 0 0 0 8.5,12.6 A 4.1,4.1 0 0 0 8.5,4.4 Z M 12.89,11.91 L 17.19,16.21 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 16.21,17.19 L 11.91,12.89 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 12.89,11.91 Z" />
                </Button>

                <Button
                    x:Name="BackButton"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="返回"
                    Click="OnBackClicked"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="返回">
                    <!-- 箭头：一根横杆加两笔斜的，三笔的圆头都压在同一点 (3.7,10) 上，所以尖也是圆的 —— 平头
                         切出来的尖是那一排看着最「扎」的地方。前进那颗是这一颗左右翻过来的。 -->
                    <PathIcon Data="M 3.7,9.3 L 16.3,9.3 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 16.3,10.7 L 3.7,10.7 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 3.7,9.3 Z M 3.21,9.51 L 8.81,3.91 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 9.79,4.89 L 4.19,10.49 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 3.21,9.51 Z M 4.19,9.51 L 9.79,15.11 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 8.81,16.09 L 3.21,10.49 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 4.19,9.51 Z" />
                </Button>

                <Button
                    x:Name="ForwardButton"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="前进"
                    Click="OnForwardClicked"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="前进">
                    <!-- Alt+Left is NavigationView's own, raised as BackRequested; nothing raises the
                         other half, so the forward arrow states it. -->
                    <Button.KeyboardAccelerators>
                        <KeyboardAccelerator Key="Right" Modifiers="Menu" />
                    </Button.KeyboardAccelerators>
                    <PathIcon Data="M 16.3,10.7 L 3.7,10.7 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 3.7,9.3 L 16.3,9.3 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 16.3,10.7 Z M 15.81,10.49 L 10.21,4.89 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 11.19,3.91 L 16.79,9.51 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 15.81,10.49 Z M 16.79,10.49 L 11.19,16.09 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 10.21,15.11 L 15.81,9.51 A 0.7,0.7 0 0 1 16.79,10.49 Z" />
                </Button>
            </StackPanel>
        </Grid>

        <!-- ItemInvoked, not SelectionChanged (requirement 6: 「点击主页或者左侧的家园图标后，要直接回到主页
             界面」). SelectionChanged only fires when the selection actually moves, and drilling into a series
             or a season leaves the pane highlight sitting on 主页 while the frame shows something else — so
             clicking 主页 selected nothing new and did nothing at all. ItemInvoked fires on every click,
             including a click on the already-highlighted entry, which is exactly the gesture the requirement
             is about. GoTo still guards on _current, and the drill-down paths now clear the highlight, so the
             two agree either way round.

             The pane's own toggle and its settings entry are both off: 折叠侧边栏 and 设置 are two of the five
             buttons in the title bar now, and a second copy of either inside the pane would be one more
             control to keep in sync for no gain.

             IsPaneOpen 一开始就是 False（「侧边栏默认为折叠状态」）：起手是 48 像素的窄条，标题栏那颗折叠键
             把它张开。收着这一档本来就一直在（账号那块、标题栏的墨、那一排按键的缩进都各自认它），改的只是
             开窗时站在哪一档。PaneDisplayMode 写死 Left，所以这里不是「小窗口自动收起来」那套自适应 —— 收着
             就是窄条，不是把侧边栏整个藏掉。
             写在这儿的这个 False 只是起点，收不住：套上模板时 NavigationView 会照 PaneDisplayMode="Left" 把自己
             判成「张开」那一档，顺手把 IsPaneOpen 推回 true。真正把它按住的是 ShellPage 构造函数里挂的那个
             一次性 Loaded（FoldOnce）—— 模板套完再关一次。这里仍然留着 False，是为了让标记自己说清起手那一档
             是什么。
             状态一开始就对，事件却不一定响：PaneClosed/PaneOpened 只在「变了」的时候来，而这是初值。所以跟着
             侧边栏走的那几样东西由 ShellPage 的构造函数直接算一遍（SyncPane），不等事件。 -->
        <NavigationView
            x:Name="Navigation"
            AlwaysShowHeader="False"
            IsBackButtonVisible="Collapsed"
            IsBackEnabled="False"
            IsPaneOpen="False"
            IsPaneToggleButtonVisible="False"
            IsSettingsVisible="False"
            IsTitleBarAutoPaddingEnabled="False"
            ItemInvoked="OnItemInvoked"
            OpenPaneLength="248"
            PaneDisplayMode="Left"
            PaneClosed="OnPaneToggled"
            PaneOpened="OnPaneToggled"
            BackRequested="OnBackRequested"
            Visibility="Collapsed">

            <!--
              框架给「工作区」那一块自己画了一道边和一个圆角（左上角内缩 8、上边和左边各一像素）。原来那
              一块顶上还压着一条标题栏，所以看不出来；现在那一块是一张铺满的剧照，那三样东西就是图的顶边
              一道缝、左边一道缝、左上角一个豁口 —— 「红框框出来的地方全填充上海报」要去掉的正是这些。
              自检里 主页大图贴边 那一行量的就是它：改之前起点是 (250,1)，而工作区的左边沿在 249、窗口顶
              边在 0。三个键设在这个控件自己身上，同 ShelfStrip 里那几颗键的做法：模板里的 ThemeResource
              从被套模板的那个元素往上找，所以这三行只管这一个 NavigationView。
            -->
            <NavigationView.Resources>
                <Thickness x:Key="NavigationViewContentGridBorderThickness">0</Thickness>
                <CornerRadius x:Key="NavigationViewContentGridCornerRadius">0</CornerRadius>
                <Thickness x:Key="NavigationViewContentMargin">0</Thickness>
            </NavigationView.Resources>

            <!-- No PaneHeader and no AutoSuggestBox any more.

                 需求 2 是「用户和媒体服务器去掉头像，然后移动到窗口左下方」, so the account button that used
                 to sit at the top of the pane is in NavigationView.PaneFooter below, which is the bottom of
                 the pane and therefore the bottom-left of the window.

                 The search box left with it: 需求 1 makes 搜索 a title-bar button that 「直接在当前窗口跳转」
                 to a page whose own box is the first thing focused, so a second box permanently parked in
                 the pane would be a duplicate that is narrower and further from the results. -->

            <!-- The three entries below are the fixed part of the pane. Everything after the 媒体库
                 header is added in code from the server's own library list, so the pane says what this
                 account actually has instead of what the last build guessed it would have.

                 第一项顶上让出 32：标题栏那一条现在浮在整个窗口的上面，包括侧边栏这一段（见最外层那段
                 说明），不让开的话「主页」这一行就压在那五颗按钮底下。数写在第一项身上而不是 PaneHeader
                 上，因为侧边栏收成 48 像素的窄条时这一项还在，PaneHeader 在不在则要看框架的心情。 -->
            <NavigationView.MenuItems>
                <NavigationViewItem Content="主页" Margin="0,32,0,0" Tag="home">
                    <NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE80F;" />
                    </NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                </NavigationViewItem>
                <NavigationViewItemSeparator />

                <!-- 分组名走眉字：等宽、字距拉开、比正文淡一档 —— 和每一页页头最上面那行代号是同一种字。
                     分割线说「换区了」，这行字说「换到哪一区」，两件事各归一样东西。
                     四个属性设在 header 自己身上，而不是往 Content 里塞一个带样式的 TextBlock：那样试过，
                     这控件的模板不是拿 ContentPresenter 摆内容的，塞进去的元素一个像素都不画。字体属性会从
                     Control 继承到模板里那块文字上，所以设在外面才落得下去。 -->
                <NavigationViewItemHeader
                    x:Name="LibraryHeader"
                    CharacterSpacing="{StaticResource EgEyebrowSpacing}"
                    Content="媒体库"
                    FontFamily="{StaticResource EgDataFontFamily}"
                    FontSize="{StaticResource EgEyebrowFontSize}"
                    Foreground="{ThemeResource EgTextFaintBrush}" />

            </NavigationView.MenuItems>

            <!-- 需求 2 的后半句：「诊断和服务器移动到设置里」. Both were footer entries in this pane; they are
                 categories in the settings window now, which frees the pane's footer for the account button
                 the first half of the same requirement asks to move down here.

                 PaneFooter rather than one more FooterMenuItems entry: this is not a destination. It is a
                 button with a flyout, and as an item NavigationView would draw it with a selection highlight
                 and enter it into the selection model, so opening its flyout would look like navigating. -->
            <NavigationView.PaneFooter>
                <StackPanel>
                    <!-- 列表和账号之间的那道缝，和窗口顶上那条、页头那条是同一根线。侧边栏因此分成两段：
                         上面是「去哪」，下面是「你是谁」。 -->
                    <Border Margin="12,0,12,0" Style="{StaticResource EgRuleStyle}" />

                    <Button
                        x:Name="AccountButton"
                        Margin="4,8,4,8"
                        Padding="8,6"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                        HorizontalContentAlignment="Left"
                        Background="Transparent"
                        BorderThickness="0"
                        CornerRadius="{StaticResource EgCardCornerRadius}">
                        <Grid ColumnSpacing="10">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                            <!-- 「去掉头像」: the PersonPicture is gone, and this glyph is not a stand-in for it.
                                 It is only what the button has left to show once the pane is collapsed to 48
                                 pixels and neither line of text fits. In the pane's normal open state it is
                                 collapsed and the button is two lines of text with a chevron. -->
                            <FontIcon
                                x:Name="AccountGlyph"
                                FontSize="15"
                                Foreground="{ThemeResource EgTextDimBrush}"
                                Glyph="&#xE77B;"
                                Visibility="Collapsed"
                                VerticalAlignment="Center" />

                            <StackPanel x:Name="AccountDetails" Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <TextBlock
                                    x:Name="AccountUser"
                                    FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                    Text="未登录"
                                    TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                                <!-- 服务器名走读数字（EgDataStyle）：和页头右上角那行、和卡片上的年份时长
                                     是同一种字。它是机器串，不是一句话。 -->
                                <TextBlock
                                    x:Name="AccountServer"
                                    Style="{StaticResource EgDataStyle}"
                                    Text="未连接服务器"
                                    TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" />
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- Points up, because the menu it opens now comes up out of the bottom of the
                                 window rather than down out of the top of the pane. -->
                            <FontIcon
                                x:Name="AccountChevron"
                                Grid.Column="2"
                                FontSize="12"
                                Foreground="{ThemeResource EgTextFaintBrush}"
                                Glyph="&#xE70E;"
                                VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                        </Grid>
                        <Button.Flyout>
                            <MenuFlyout Placement="TopEdgeAlignedLeft">
                                <MenuFlyoutSubItem x:Name="ServerMenu" Text="切换服务器">
                                    <MenuFlyoutSubItem.Icon>
                                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE968;" />
                                    </MenuFlyoutSubItem.Icon>
                                </MenuFlyoutSubItem>
                                <MenuFlyoutSubItem x:Name="UserMenu" Text="切换用户">
                                    <MenuFlyoutSubItem.Icon>
                                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE77B;" />
                                    </MenuFlyoutSubItem.Icon>
                                </MenuFlyoutSubItem>
                                <MenuFlyoutSeparator />
                                <MenuFlyoutItem Click="OnSignOut" Text="注销">
                                    <MenuFlyoutItem.Icon>
                                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xE7E8;" />
                                    </MenuFlyoutItem.Icon>
                                </MenuFlyoutItem>
                            </MenuFlyout>
                        </Button.Flyout>
                    </Button>
                </StackPanel>
            </NavigationView.PaneFooter>

            <!-- The breadcrumb row. The two arrows used to share it; they are up in the title bar now, where
                 the Claude app keeps them, so all that is left here is the trail — and the row goes away
                 with it. A row that is present but empty is the 「空荡荡」 band, and it would also push every
                 page down by 38 pixels for nothing.

                 NavigationView.Header is not used for this. Its own rule is
                 「showHeader = AlwaysShowHeader || (top nav) || Minimal」, so with AlwaysShowHeader off and
                 the pane Expanded on the left — this window's normal state — whatever is assigned to
                 Header is never rendered at all. A row of this Grid always renders.

                 Same brush as every page, so row and page composite identically over Mica and read as one
                 surface. -->
            <!-- 侧边栏和工作区之间那道竖缝。窗口顶上原来那道横的没有了（见最外层那段说明），所以现在整个
                 窗口的结构就靠这一根线：它从 y=0 通到底，左边是面板，右边是片场。侧边栏和工作区的底色只差
                 一档（EgWindowBrush 对 LayerFillColorDefaultBrush 透出的 Mica），差到看得出是两块、看不出
                 边在哪里；补上这根发丝线，窗口才读成「面板 + 片场」两块，而不是一片深色里浮着几行字。
                 画在自己这棵树上而不是找框架的键：NavigationView 的分隔线归它的模板管，而这条线的位置就是
                 我们内容根的左边，自己画的才一定在该在的地方。

                 ContentHost 顶上留出 32 并自己上底色：标题栏那一条压在这一列的上面，页面从第 32 行起画，
                 那 32 像素由这里补上底色（页面自己的底色和它同一支，多涂一层看不出来）。整套里只有主页把
                 这 32 顶开 —— 见 HomePage.xaml 里那块大图。 -->
            <Border BorderBrush="{ThemeResource EgBorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1,0,0,0">
                <Grid
                    x:Name="ContentHost"
                    Background="{ThemeResource LayerFillColorDefaultBrush}"
                    Padding="0,32,0,0">
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <!-- 左右 28，和 EgPageMargin 的左右 28 一样：面包屑和它底下那块场记板因此左对齐在同一
                         条竖线上。原来是 18，于是「媒体库 › 剧名」比页面标题往左出去 10 像素 —— 一整条别的
                         都对齐了的界面里，这种 10 像素是最显眼的那种脏。

                         底色和墨都由 PaintTitleInk 画，这里不写：详情页的剧照要「跟主页一样，占满标题栏」，
                         也就是从窗口顶边一路铺到这一行的底下，那时这一行必须是透明的 —— 一条实心条压在图上
                         就是那个要求要去掉的黑边。两种底两种墨，一处判断，写在代码里那一处。

                         ZIndex 而不是挪声明顺序：ContentFrame 是后一个孩子，天生画在这一行的上面，而页面里
                         那张固定的剧照正是往上顶过这一行的。数字提上来，字就在图上；顺序不动，读这个文件的人
                         还是先看到面包屑、后看到页面。 -->
                    <Grid
                        x:Name="TrailBar"
                        Canvas.ZIndex="1"
                        Padding="28,8,28,8"
                        Visibility="Collapsed">
                        <Grid.Resources>
                            <!-- 这一行的墨：字和字中间那个人字尖共用一支。
                                 一支可改颜色的画刷、不是两个键各写一个色：改字典里的键对已经画出来的那几格
                                 没有用（它们握着的是解析时那个对象），改这一个对象的 Color 才当场跟着变 ——
                                 和 ThemeHost、和标题栏那两支墨同一个道理。
                                 人字尖归框架的模板画，认的是 BreadcrumbBarNormalForegroundBrush 这个键，所以
                                 构造时把同一支画刷也挂到那个键上（见 ShellPage.xaml.cs）。 -->
                            <SolidColorBrush x:Key="EgTrailInkBrush" />
                        </Grid.Resources>

                        <!-- ItemsSource is assigned in code: the trail is a private field, and a breadcrumb
                             of one entry only repeats the heading the page draws right below this row. -->
                        <BreadcrumbBar
                            x:Name="Trail"
                            ItemClicked="OnBreadcrumbClicked"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center">
                            <!-- 走读数字：一条路径是「你在哪」的机器串，不是一句话，所以和页头右上角那行、
                                 和账号下面那行服务器名同一种字。Binding 而不是 x:Bind —— 一格面包屑的数据
                                 就是那个 Crumb 本身，靠它的 ToString 出字，没有属性可绑。
                                 Foreground 写在这里而不是让 EgDataStyle 说：那支样式自己设了 Foreground，
                                 而写在格子上的值压得过样式里的 setter。 -->
                            <BreadcrumbBar.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Foreground="{StaticResource EgTrailInkBrush}"
                                        Style="{StaticResource EgDataStyle}"
                                        Text="{Binding}" />
                                </DataTemplate>
                            </BreadcrumbBar.ItemTemplate>
                        </BreadcrumbBar>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- Transitions cleared, not defaulted: requirement 9 rules out the page fade. -->
                    <Frame x:Name="ContentFrame" Grid.Row="1" Transitions="{x:Null}" />
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </NavigationView>

        <local:SignInPage x:Name="SignIn" />

        <!-- The player, a sibling rather than a page in the frame. It has to be able to take the whole
             window: the island is one shared surface, so anything still visible behind it would paint
             its own opaque background over the region where mpv's child window shows through. -->
        <local:PlayerPage x:Name="Player" Canvas.ZIndex="20" />

        <!-- The shell's one notification channel, replacing the WinForms toast window. Docked at the
             top because the player owns the bottom of the window, and closable because a report of what
             a playback did is worth reading at the user's pace rather than the timer's.
             顶上 44 = 标题栏那 32 加原来的 12：这一条不该压在那五颗按钮上。 -->
        <InfoBar
            x:Name="Toast"
            Canvas.ZIndex="30"
            HorizontalAlignment="Center"
            VerticalAlignment="Top"
            Margin="0,44,0,0"
            MaxWidth="560"
            IsClosable="True"
            IsOpen="False" />
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
